
# LetsDefend — My SOC Foundation


---

## Why I Started Here

Before LetsDefend, SOC was just another job title to me.
I knew it existed but had no real picture of what the 
work actually looked like day to day.

LetsDefend changed that. It gave me the foundation I 
needed before touching real tools — the "why" behind 
