### Network and Linux — The Non-Negotiables

**Network Fundamentals (100% complete)**
You cannot investigate network-based attacks without 
understanding how traffic flows. Subnets, routing, 
protocols — these aren't just theory. They are the 
language of every alert Suricata generates.

**Linux for Blue Team (94% complete)**
Most security infrastructure runs on Linux. Wazuh, 
Suricata, and my entire home lab live on Ubuntu. 
LetsDefend taught me Linux not as a general user 
but as a security practitioner — navigating logs, 
managing services, reading system output under pressure.

